{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>And for the hindmost.</b> A term of 'end,' as its Targum renders: וְלִסְיָפֵי. And because the entrance was on the east, the east is called 'front' and the west 'back' — and that is the 'end,' since the front is the head." "<b>You shall make six boards.</b> That is nine cubits wide."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:54:46.560109023Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}